WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.939
"Are we there yet?" Gliss complained. "We've been walking forever!"

2
00:00:05.940 --> 00:00:11.048
It was the following morning, but Darb still hadn't told his friends what his idea was.

3
00:00:11.049 --> 00:00:13.627
He'd said it would be easier to show them.

4
00:00:13.628 --> 00:00:20.966
After a quick breakfast of glowberries and rainwater, he'd led them on a long walk through the swamp and the thick forest east of town.

5
00:00:20.967 --> 00:00:26.674
Eventually the trees had thinned out into an area of small farms and open land.

6
00:00:26.675 --> 00:00:32.341
"We're almost there," Darb said. "You'll see it as soon as we get to the top of the next hill."

7
00:00:32.342 --> 00:00:38.315
He led the way up the hill. When Zann caught up to Darb, he saw a farm spread out beneath them.

8
00:00:38.316 --> 00:00:42.008
It had several paddocks full of large, grazing dragons!

9
00:00:42.009 --> 00:00:45.826
"There," Darb said with a smile, pointing to the dragons.

10
00:00:45.827 --> 00:00:48.456
"That's how we can get to First City."

11
00:00:48.457 --> 00:00:52.011
"But I don't know how to ride a dragon," Gliss exclaimed.

12
00:00:52.012 --> 00:00:59.016
"I don't either," Perda said. "I begged for lessons, but my parents wanted me to focus on my spells."

13
00:00:59.017 --> 00:01:02.900
"I started learning last year after I left school," Darb said.

14
00:01:02.901 --> 00:01:07.233
"I come here a lot and help the farmer with his work in exchange for lessons."

15
00:01:07.234 --> 00:01:13.115
Zann was surprised. He'd never thought much about what his friend did while everyone else was in school.

16
00:01:13.116 --> 00:01:16.351
Who could have guessed that Darb was learning to ride dragons?

17
00:01:16.352 --> 00:01:19.017
Darb hurried off to talk to the farmer.

18
00:01:19.018 --> 00:01:23.480
Moments later he was back with permission to borrow two dragons.

19
00:01:23.481 --> 00:01:27.549
"We can ride double," he said as they entered the closest paddock.

20
00:01:27.550 --> 00:01:32.565
He smiled at Gliss. "If you want to ride with me, I can show you the best ways to hold on."

21
00:01:32.566 --> 00:01:38.372
"Oh!" Gliss shot Zann an uncertain look. "Um, okay. Thanks."

22
00:01:38.373 --> 00:01:42.415
"Guess that means I'm stuck with you," Perda told Zann with a shrug.

23
00:01:42.416 --> 00:01:48.876
Zann didn't answer. For one thing, the thought of riding double with Perda made him feel weirdly nervous.

24
00:01:48.877 --> 00:01:52.120
For another, they'd just reached the dragons.

25
00:01:52.121 --> 00:01:54.423
One of the huge creatures looked up.

26
00:01:54.424 --> 00:01:58.790
It had large, gentle eyes and iridescent purple scales.

27
00:01:58.791 --> 00:02:01.664
Zing scurried over to sniff its nose.

28
00:02:01.665 --> 00:02:07.010
When Zing let out a tiny burst of flame, the bigger dragon jumped back in surprise.

29
00:02:07.011 --> 00:02:12.672
"Behave, Zing," Zann warned. "Otherwise Darb will tell these guys to eat you."

30
00:02:12.673 --> 00:02:16.147
"They don't eat anything but plants—they're cloud gliders."

31
00:02:16.148 --> 00:02:19.106
Darb patted one of the large dragons.

32
00:02:19.107 --> 00:02:24.342
"Their owner thinks they'll be easier to handle than the wind racers even though they're not quite as fast."

33
00:02:24.343 --> 00:02:28.885
He gestured at several larger, fiercer-looking dragons in the next paddock.

34
00:02:28.886 --> 00:02:34.445
"I'll take his word for it." Zann stared up at the nearest cloud glider.

35
00:02:34.446 --> 00:02:39.053
Was he really about to climb onto this huge creature and soar into the air?

36
00:02:39.054 --> 00:02:45.356
Once again he found himself thinking that having adventures was a lot scarier than he'd ever expected. Still,

37
00:02:45.357 --> 00:02:49.366
he wasn't about to let the girls see that he was nervous. "What

38
00:02:49.367 --> 00:02:53.513
are we waiting for?" he exclaimed. "Let's go!" Grabbing

39
00:02:53.514 --> 00:02:57.177
the cloud glider's wing, he vaulted onto its back. The

40
00:02:57.178 --> 00:03:03.566
dragon gave a snort of surprise and leaped straight into the air. Zann tumbled to the ground. "Zann!"

41
00:03:03.567 --> 00:03:07.244
Gliss exclaimed. "Are you okay?" "I'm

42
00:03:07.245 --> 00:03:12.146
fine." Zann winced as he stood up. Pretty

43
00:03:12.147 --> 00:03:18.746
sure that a bruise was already forming on his backside, he turned to Darb with a sheepish smile. "Maybe

44
00:03:18.747 --> 00:03:22.208
you'd better give us a quick lesson." Darb

45
00:03:22.209 --> 00:03:25.546
explained how to handle and steer the dragons. Then

46
00:03:25.547 --> 00:03:28.490
he helped Zann mount the correct way. "Zann,

47
00:03:28.491 --> 00:03:34.376
you hold on to the dragon's neck," he said. "Perda, you hold on to Zann." "This

48
00:03:34.377 --> 00:03:39.415
is scary," Perda said as she settled into place behind Zann. He

49
00:03:39.416 --> 00:03:42.995
could feel her breath on his neck and smell her hair. He

50
00:03:42.996 --> 00:03:46.959
tried not to react as she slipped her arms around his waist. "You'd

51
00:03:46.960 --> 00:03:50.062
better hold on tight," he said. "I'm

52
00:03:50.063 --> 00:03:53.684
not jumping down to catch you if you fall off." She

53
00:03:53.685 --> 00:03:59.032
laughed. " I'm not the one who already fell off, remember?"

54
00:03:59.033 --> 00:04:03.084
By then Darb and Gliss had climbed onto the other dragon.

55
00:04:03.085 --> 00:04:06.522
"Ready?" Darb called. "Hang on and follow us!"

56
00:04:06.523 --> 00:04:12.199
Darb's dragon leaped into the air. Zann could feel his own dragon gathering its muscles.

57
00:04:12.200 --> 00:04:15.425
He held on tightly as the beast sprang upward.

58
00:04:15.426 --> 00:04:21.676
The wind from its wings rushed past Zann's head.

59
00:04:21.677 --> 00:04:25.947
"We're flying!" Perda said with a laugh.

60
00:04:25.948 --> 00:04:30.246
Zann grinned. "Yeah!"

61
00:04:30.247 --> 00:04:34.195
Morb smiled as another red light on the map blinked off.

62
00:04:34.196 --> 00:04:38.388
"Good," he thought. The trolls were working fast.

63
00:04:38.389 --> 00:04:42.286
A moment later he heard a cell door slam shut in the dungeon.

64
00:04:42.287 --> 00:04:46.857
The new prisoners yelled angry protests at the trolls who had captured them.

65
00:04:46.858 --> 00:04:54.956
"If they're upset now, wait until they find out what I have planned next," he muttered with a cackle.

66
00:04:54.957 --> 00:04:59.229
His gaze fell on the discarded blink images of Zann and his friends.

67
00:04:59.230 --> 00:05:01.821
Seeing them made his good mood waver.

68
00:05:01.822 --> 00:05:07.458
How had a handful of puny children managed to evade him? It was infuriating!

69
00:05:07.459 --> 00:05:11.908
But he tried not to think about that. Soon it wouldn't matter.

70
00:05:11.909 --> 00:05:19.142
Turning away from the Secret Eye, Morb stepped over to a rough wooden desk and picked up a frayed blink image.

71
00:05:19.143 --> 00:05:21.637
It was a portrait of a large family.

72
00:05:21.638 --> 00:05:25.959
There were two handsome, smiling parents, both Reds.

73
00:05:25.960 --> 00:05:31.022
Around them were a dozen children, more than half of them Reds as well.

74
00:05:31.023 --> 00:05:35.137
But Morb's gaze barely flickered over most of the cheerful figures.

75
00:05:35.138 --> 00:05:42.747
His focus rested on an unsmiling, skinny, amber-eyed little boy. The family's only Void.

76
00:05:42.748 --> 00:05:47.490
Morb stared at the boy for a long moment, and then tossed the picture aside.

77
00:05:47.491 --> 00:05:51.419
He wasn't that pathetic little Void anymore.

78
00:05:51.420 --> 00:05:59.905
And soon everyone in Magica would know it.

